T001: Basic resource tick engine — gold/food/wood rates, HUD display, 4 ticks/second loop.
Built tick.js (TICKS_PER_SECOND=4, gameTick counter), resources.js (rates object, applyRates each tick), hud.js (DOM update for gold/food/wood), main.js boot sequence.

T002: Building purchase system — farm/lumbermill/mine/barracks with gold costs, resource rate bonuses.
Built buildings.js (BUILDINGS catalog with cost/rates/requires), actions.js (purchaseBuilding with validation), buildingPanel.js (render list + buy buttons).

T003: Save/load with localStorage — JSON serialise state, load on boot if present.
Added _save()/_loadSave() in main.js, versioned save object (v1), auto-save every 30s, load button in UI.

T004: Message log — timestamped event messages in scrollable panel, max 50 entries.
Built messages.js (addMessage, getMessages), messagePanel.js (render list, auto-scroll), wired to building purchases and resource events.

T005: Technology research queue — 3 techs (Bronze Tools/Stone Walls/Iron Smelting), sequential research with tick countdown.
Built techs.js (TECHS catalog, researchTick), techPanel.js (render queue + available list), actions.js purchaseTech.

T006: Unit training — soldier/archer/cavalry with food upkeep, training time, population cap.
Built units.js (UNITS catalog, trainingTick, upkeep deduction), unitPanel.js, actions.js trainUnit.

T007: Map system — 20×20 tile grid, fog of war, capital tile, neutral/enemy territory.
Built map.js (initMap, MAP_W=20/MAP_H=20, tile types: plains/forest/mountain/water), mapPanel.js (CSS grid render with fog).

T008: Combat system — attack adjacent tile, preview odds, loot collection on capture.
Built combat.js (getAttackPreview, attackTile with RNG outcome), mapPanel.js click handler, loot applied to resources.

T009: Age progression — Stone→Bronze→Iron→Medieval gates, auto-advance on tech completion.
Built ages.js (AGE_REQS, checkAgeAdvance), agePanel.js display, age-gated building/unit unlocks.

T010: Diplomacy — 3 AI empires, relations (neutral/war/allied), trade route income, war declarations.
Built diplomacy.js (EMPIRES catalog, initDiplomacy, diplomaticAction), diplomacyPanel.js, AI tick logic.

T011: Hero system — recruit hero, 3 abilities (Battle Cry/Inspire/Siege) with cooldowns.
Built hero.js (initHero, useAbility, heroBonuses), heroPanel.js, ability buttons with cooldown display.

T012: Random events — 10 event types with resource modifiers, 5–15 min intervals.
Built randomEvents.js (EVENT_TYPES, randomEventTick, activeModifiers applied in resources.js), eventPanel display.

T013: Quest system — 8 quests tracking game milestones, reward gold/prestige on completion.
Built quests.js (QUESTS catalog, checkQuests called each tick), questPanel.js progress display.

T014: Story log — empire timeline entries on milestones (age-up, conquest, ally, etc.).
Built story.js (addStoryEntry, STORY_ICONS), storyPanel.js scrollable timeline.

